{%- comment -%}
  Snippet: product-card
  Receives: product (Shopify product object)
  Renders: portrait card with image, badges, wishlist toggle, quick-add, color swatches, title, price
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- comment -%}
  Card height is fixed rather than content-driven. Titles run from two words to a
  full line and colour swatches only appear on multi-colour products, so letting
  the body size itself leaves every row of the grid ragged.
{%- endcomment -%}
<article class="relative group overflow-hidden bg-cream flex flex-col h-full">
  <a href="{{ product.url }}" class="block">

    {%- comment -%} IMAGE BLOCK {%- endcomment -%}
    <div class="relative overflow-hidden aspect-[3/4]">
      {%- if product.featured_image != blank -%}
        {%- comment -%}
          Absolutely filled rather than h-full. The supplier ships a few landscape
          photos (v9868 is 500x413 where most are 500x750); with a percentage
          height chain of div -> span -> img those rendered at their natural ratio
          and left the bottom of the card empty, so rows looked misaligned even
          though every box was the same height. Pinning to the box makes
          object-cover crop regardless of the source ratio.
        {%- endcomment -%}
        <span id="card-img-{{ product.id }}" class="absolute inset-0 block scale-100 group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-500">
          {%- comment -%}
            Four cards per row means each is roughly 300px wide, so 500px covers
            a 1.5x display without shipping a needlessly large file.
          {%- endcomment -%}
          {%- render 'cloudinary-img',
            image: product.featured_image,
            width: 500,
            alt: product.featured_image.alt | default: product.title,
            class: 'w-full h-full object-cover',
            loading: 'lazy'
          -%}
        </span>
      {%- else -%}
        <div class="w-full h-full bg-sand"></div>
      {%- endif -%}

      {%- comment -%} BADGES {%- endcomment -%}
      <div class="absolute top-3 left-3 flex flex-col gap-1 z-10">
        {%- if product.compare_at_price > product.price -%}
          <span class="bg-coral text-cream text-xs font-body px-2 py-0.5">Sale</span>
        {%- endif -%}
        {%- if product.tags contains 'new' -%}
          <span class="bg-deep text-cream text-xs font-body px-2 py-0.5">New</span>
        {%- endif -%}
      </div>

      {%- comment -%} WISHLIST TOGGLE {%- endcomment -%}
      <div class="absolute top-3 right-3 z-10">
        {%- if customer != blank -%}
          <button
            type="button"
            class="text-deep/40 hover:text-coral transition-colors"
            aria-label="Add {{ product.title | escape }} to wishlist"
            data-product-id="{{ product.id }}"
            data-wishlist-toggle
          >
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
              <path d="M20.84 4.61a5.5 5.5 0 0 0-7.78 0L12 5.67l-1.06-1.06a5.5 5.5 0 0 0-7.78 7.78l1.06 1.06L12 21.23l7.78-7.78 1.06-1.06a5.5 5.5 0 0 0 0-7.78z"></path>
            </svg>
          </button>
        {%- else -%}
          <a
            href="/account/login?return_url={{ product.url | url_encode }}"
            class="text-deep/40 hover:text-coral transition-colors"
            aria-label="Add {{ product.title | escape }} to wishlist"
          >
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
              <path d="M20.84 4.61a5.5 5.5 0 0 0-7.78 0L12 5.67l-1.06-1.06a5.5 5.5 0 0 0-7.78 7.78l1.06 1.06L12 21.23l7.78-7.78 1.06-1.06a5.5 5.5 0 0 0 0-7.78z"></path>
            </svg>
          </a>
        {%- endif -%}
      </div>

      {%- comment -%} QUICK-ADD FORM {%- endcomment -%}
      {%- assign first_variant = product.first_available_variant -%}
      {%- if first_variant -%}
        <form action="/cart/add" method="post" class="absolute bottom-0 left-0 right-0">
          <input type="hidden" name="id" value="{{ first_variant.id }}">
          <button
            type="submit"
            class="w-full bg-deep text-cream py-3 font-body text-xs tracking-widest uppercase translate-y-full group-hover:translate-y-0 transition-transform duration-300 cursor-pointer"
            data-quick-add
            data-variant-id="{{ first_variant.id }}"
          >
            Quick Add
          </button>
        </form>
      {%- else -%}
        <div class="absolute bottom-0 left-0 right-0">
          <span class="w-full bg-mid text-cream py-3 font-body text-xs tracking-widest uppercase flex items-center justify-center translate-y-full group-hover:translate-y-0 transition-transform duration-300">
            Sold Out
          </span>
        </div>
      {%- endif -%}

    </div>
  </a>

  {%- comment -%} CARD BODY {%- endcomment -%}
  <div class="p-3 flex flex-col flex-1">

    {%- comment -%} COLOR SWATCHES {%- endcomment -%}
    {%- assign color_option_index = nil -%}
    {%- for option in product.options_with_values -%}
      {%- if option.name == 'Color' -%}
        {%- assign color_option_index = forloop.index0 -%}
      {%- endif -%}
    {%- endfor -%}

    {%- comment -%}
      The swatch row keeps its height even when a product has no colour options,
      so single-colour and multi-colour cards still line up with each other.
    {%- endcomment -%}
    {%- if color_option_index != nil -%}
      {%- assign seen_colors = '' -%}
      <div class="flex gap-1 mb-2 h-3.5 overflow-hidden">
        {%- for variant in product.variants -%}
          {%- assign variant_color = variant.options[color_option_index] -%}
          {%- unless seen_colors contains variant_color -%}
            {%- assign seen_colors = seen_colors | append: variant_color | append: '|' -%}
            <button
              type="button"
              class="w-3.5 h-3.5 rounded-full border border-deep/20 cursor-pointer hover:ring-2 hover:ring-offset-1 hover:ring-deep"
              style="background-color: {%- render 'swatch-color', color: variant_color -%}"
              aria-label="{{ variant_color | escape }}"
              data-swatch-color="{{ variant_color | escape }}"
              data-variant-id="{{ variant.id }}"
              data-variant-image="{{ variant.featured_image | image_url: width: 600 }}"
              data-card-id="{{ product.id }}"
            ></button>
          {%- endunless -%}
        {%- endfor -%}
      </div>
    {%- else -%}
      <div class="mb-2 h-3.5" aria-hidden="true"></div>
    {%- endif -%}

    {%- comment -%}
      Two lines, always. Supplier titles carry a "— Style 11022" suffix, so most
      wrap; clamping keeps a long title from pushing its card taller than its
      neighbours.
    {%- endcomment -%}
    <p class="font-body text-sm font-normal text-deep leading-snug line-clamp-2 min-h-[2.5rem]">{{ product.title | escape }}</p>
    <p class="font-body text-sm font-semibold tracking-wide text-deep mt-auto pt-1">
      {{ product.price | money }}
      {%- if product.compare_at_price > product.price -%}
        <span class="text-xs font-body text-mid line-through ml-2">{{ product.compare_at_price | money }}</span>
      {%- endif -%}
    </p>

  </div>
</article>
